    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"the quiet, absolute peace of deciding you won't play their game anymore\"... what does that even mean? it feels like there's no way out that isn't just more suffering or just waiting for them to finish me off. like, every direction i look, i just see more of the same filth. everything is just broken.",
